### WD-5136 — Optimization/saveRoutes
# Igual que optimizeRoutes y además guarda la corrida en un plan de optimización NUEVO, como
# si se hubiera creado en Optimizaciones de Reactive. La corrida se calcula aquí: no se
# puede mandar una solución. El plan se asigna por horario (scheduleId) o por fechas
# (startDate y endDate). Requiere el permiso de crear optimizaciones (OO002).
# OJO: los casos 1 y 2 crean un plan en la organización; borrarlo desde Reactive al terminar.
# Errores: 400 = 1011, 500 = 1004.

### 1) Por fechas, con prioridad alta en Adriatika
POST {{baseUrl}}/Optimization/saveRoutes
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "planName": "PRUEBA WD-5136 saveRoutes",
  "optimizationName": "Corrida por fechas",
  "originLocationId": 4202,
  "unitIds": [2361, 2362],
  "startDate": "2026-11-10T08:00:00",
  "endDate": "2026-11-10T16:00:00",
  "stops": [
    { "locationId": 4074, "priority": "high", "timeWindowStart": "09:00", "timeWindowEnd": "11:00" },
    { "locationId": 4133 },
    { "locationId": 4135 }
  ]
}

### 2) Por horario (reemplazar scheduleId por uno de la organización)
POST {{baseUrl}}/Optimization/saveRoutes
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "planName": "PRUEBA WD-5136 saveRoutes horario",
  "originLocationId": 4202,
  "destinationLocationId": 4152,
  "unitIds": [2361, 2362],
  "scheduleId": 18,
  "stops": [{ "locationId": 4074 }, { "locationId": 4133 }, { "locationId": 4135 }]
}

### 3) 400: sin horario ni fechas
POST {{baseUrl}}/Optimization/saveRoutes
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "planName": "x",
  "originLocationId": 4202,
  "unitIds": [2361],
  "stops": [{ "locationId": 4074 }]
}

### 4) 400: horario y fechas a la vez
POST {{baseUrl}}/Optimization/saveRoutes
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "planName": "x",
  "originLocationId": 4202,
  "unitIds": [2361],
  "scheduleId": 18,
  "startDate": "2026-11-10T08:00:00",
  "endDate": "2026-11-10T16:00:00",
  "stops": [{ "locationId": 4074 }]
}

### 5) 400: horario inexistente o no visible
POST {{baseUrl}}/Optimization/saveRoutes
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "planName": "x",
  "originLocationId": 4202,
  "unitIds": [2361],
  "scheduleId": 999999999,
  "stops": [{ "locationId": 4074 }]
}
